                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Good question - I introduced the bipartisan Pharmacists Fight Back Act to block PBM price-gouging abuses that raise premiums & co-pays and bankrupt community pharmacies.\n\nHow you can help: call your Member of Congress & encourage them to co-sponsor the #PharmacistsFightBack Act.",
