                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "What\u2019s next could be:\n- Lower Rx co-pays & premiums\n- PBMs as flat-rate service providers, not kickback conglomerates\n- Pharmacists expanding their scope of care for their communities\n\nIt starts with my bipartisan #PharmacistsFightBack Act.",
