                "reply_count": 367,
                "retweet_count": 127,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "RFK, Jr is not just a quack, he's a bigot.\n\nI represent hundreds of thousands of Jewish- and Chinese- Americans, many of whom are healthcare professionals. During the pandemic, I watched them save lives in hospitals and turn research into vaccines in laboratories. They deserve an HHS Secretary who respects science, and who respects them.",
