                "retweet_count": 96,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "CVS Caremark and the other Fortune 20 pharmacy benefit managers are price-gouging patients and bullying independent pharmacists.\n\nWe\u2019re going to keep holding their feet to the fire. #PharmacistsFightBackAct",
