                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The goal was 50 co-sponsors by Thanksgiving. #PharmacistsFightBackAct now has 50! This momentum was made possible by the pharmacists, advocates, and patients who have rallied to end PBM greed. Congress can\u2019t ignore these powerful voices. https://t.co/hgOXIkTlZh",
