                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 22,
                "retweet_count": 7,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "During the holiday season, tens of thousands of children face difficult circumstances in hospitals and other challenging environments where the joy of play is far out of mind and reach. \n\nToday, I joined @LEGO_Group's #BuildToGive initiative, to send a Lego set to a child in need.",
